2026-07-27T14:33:56.2206362Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:33:56.2206640Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:33:56.2207054Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:33:56.2208100Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:33:56.2208585Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
